# private session artifacts — never ship
.worklog/
_gen-assets.mjs

# design/ was ignored wholesale until 31 Aug 2026. That is how the 12 Aug
# team review's twelve-item plan became unreachable: five of its items were a
# guard, a decision or a hand, all addressed to a future session that had no
# way to find them, in a directory git could not see. Its own item 12 was
# "number the review folders, or un-ignore design/" — and that item died too.
# The documents are now tracked so a plan can reach forward in time. The heavy
# screen captures are not: one 2026-06 review carries 20MB of PNGs, and review
# prose is the part that has to survive, not the pixels.
design/**/*.png
design/**/*.jpg
design/**/*.jpeg
design/**/*.gif
design/**/*.mp4
design/**/*.mov

# A widget artifact written to a template-literal path whose variable was
# undefined lands here. Product code cannot produce it — path.join throws
# on undefined — but a scratch script can, and it should never be staged.
undefined/
